; TEXTEDIT where there is nothing and on a TEXT on a locked layer ([0.8.1-RT11], work
; #939; card PT11, point 2). The object prompt follows the object requests of ADR 0032,
; point 1: a point with no entity leaves the prompt, with no message; an entity on a
; locked layer is not chosen, the selection message "1 was on a locked layer." appears
; and the prompt stays. Enter ends the command: nothing changes, no Textedit step.
